# Cloudflare Workers static-assets header rules.
# Phase 15 (PWA): pin Cache-Control for the manifest so an updated manifest
# propagates within an hour. `/sw.js` gets `no-cache` now so that when the
# service worker ships (deferred behind PWA_SERVICE_WORKER) a kill-switch swap
# is never pinned by an intermediary cache; it 404s harmlessly until then.
# Verify honored post-deploy with `curl -sI` (do not assume _headers support).
/manifest.webmanifest
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600
/sw.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache
